      "name": "DrawCompositeUnit",
      "signature": "void DrawCompositeUnit(uint * pUnit, int nDrawMode)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Draws a composite unit with COF (Character animation) data.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pUnit is not NULL\n2. Check if unit flags indicate drawing is enabled (gdwBitMasks[0])\n3. If selection flag set (gdwBitMasks[0x28]), draw selection highlight cel\n4. If unit has shadow data at offset 0xBC, draw shadow with color/direction\n5. Lookup COF data from GfxInfo linked list matching unit token and mode\n6. For each layer in COF, calculate direction from animation mode\n7. Draw each layer using Ordinal_10072 with transform/palette lookup\n8. Update animation frame counter and wrap at frame count limit\n9. Advance animation tick timer every 0x42ms (66ms)\n10. If squelch flag set (gdwBitMasks[0x24]), draw squelch/mute indicator\n\nParameters:\n- pUnit: Pointer to composite unit structure (offset 0x14=X, 0x18=Y, 0xB8=GfxInfo, 0xBC=ShadowCel)\n- nDrawMode: Draw mode passed to Ordinal_10072\n\nReturns:\n- 1 if unit was drawn successfully\n- 0 if unit flags indicate no draw, or COF lookup failed\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x12 (18): Number of DWORDs to clear in draw params struct\n- 0x42 (66): Animation tick interval in milliseconds\n- 0x40 (64): Max direction count for validation\n- 0x1C (28): COF header size offset to layer data\n- 0x100 (256): Palette/transform table stride",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:f9512450ef726be2ba45f37f19d8294d",
