      "name": "RenderCompositeUnitText",
      "signature": "int RenderCompositeUnitText(uint * pUnit)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Renders text label for a composite unit (item/entity).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pUnit pointer, assert if NULL\n2. Check visibility bit flag, return 0 if not visible\n3. Determine font color based on unit type (0x10/0x12 = color 3, otherwise 0 or 1)\n4. Check unit magic (D2VD/D2ST/D2XP) to select name offset\n5. Build display text with optional title prefix\n6. Append suffix text if present (player class, etc.)\n7. Measure and truncate text if width exceeds 0x77 pixels, add ellipsis\n8. Calculate centered X position from unit X and text width\n9. Draw shadow text (if special type), then main text\n\nParameters:\n- pUnit (uint*): Composite unit structure in ECX\n\nReturns:\n- 1 on success, 0 if unit not visible\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x44324456: \"D2VD\" unit signature\n- 0x44325354: \"D2ST\" unit signature\n- 0x44325850: \"D2XP\" unit signature\n- 0x77 (119): Max text width in pixels before truncation\n- 0x10, 0x12: Unit types requiring shadow text (color 3)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "API",
      "index": "API:67a8019f20eb4743dca029d9e8ebb6ec",
