      "name": "SetCompositeMode",
      "signature": "int SetCompositeMode(CompositeUnit * pCompositeUnit, int nModeId)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Sets the animation mode for a composite unit by finding matching COF data.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validates composite unit handle is not null\n2. Traverses linked list at offset 0xB8 searching for mode ID match\n3. If mode found, copies COF header data to composite unit fields\n4. Returns success/failure status\n\nParameters:\n- pCompositeUnit (CompositeUnit*): Composite unit handle (ECX)\n- nModeId (int): Animation mode identifier to set (EDX)\n\nReturns:\n- 1 if mode found and set successfully\n- 0 if mode not found in linked list\n\nStructure Offsets (CompositeUnit):\n- +0x05: Direction count from COF\n- +0x08: Frame index (reset to 0)\n- +0x0C: Number of directions\n- +0x10: Frame rate/speed from COF\n- +0x20: Current mode ID\n- +0xB8: Pointer to mode linked list\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x897: Assert line for null handle check\n- 0x3CE: Assert line for null COF data",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "API",
      "index": "API:f37eae4b9486cb4175333f44901ab791",
