      "name": "RemapComponentIndex",
      "signature": "void RemapComponentIndex(int nMode, byte * pbyCompIdx)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Remaps a component index based on item type equivalence checks.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If nMode is 1-4 and component index > 3:\n   - Check item type against shield (3), helm (0x10), armor (0xF), weapon (2)\n   - For each matching type, search g_adwComponentTypeTable for matching record\n   - If found, update component index; otherwise apply fallback (idx % 3 + 1)\n2. If nMode is 0:\n   - Check circlet type (0x25) against frame table and item type table\n   - Remap to matching component or default to 1\n\nParameters:\n- nMode (int): Processing mode (0=circlet check, 1-4=equipment types)\n- pbyCompIdx (byte*): Pointer to component index to remap\n\nReturns:\n- void: Modifies *pbyCompIdx in place\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x03: Shield item type\n- 0x10 (16): Helm item type\n- 0x0F (15): Armor item type\n- 0x02: Weapon item type\n- 0x25 (37): Circlet item type\n- 0x0C (12): Component record stride",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:4940fb7e346f5e2821391e40007eb61c",
