      "name": "ReleaseAllCompositeUnits",
      "signature": "void ReleaseAllCompositeUnits(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Releases all composite units in the global linked list.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if global composite unit list is empty; exit if so\n2. Iterate through linked list of composite units\n3. For each unit, call ReleaseCompositeUnit and ReleasePoolAllocation\n4. Advance to next unit via offset 0xc4\n5. After list exhausted, set global list pointer to null\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: g_pCompositeUnitList (void*): Head of composite unit linked list\n\nReturns:\n- void",
