      "name": "SetDataFieldWithValidation",
      "signature": "void SetDataFieldWithValidation(void * pData, byte byValue)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Updates a data structure field with a byte value, applying validation constraints.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pData is not NULL, fail assertion if NULL\n2. Apply conditional mask to byValue: if byValue <= 0, result is 0\n3. Read constraint threshold from pData[5]\n4. Clamp result to not exceed threshold value\n5. Store clamped result to pData[4]\n\nParameters:\n- pData (void*): Pointer to data structure\n- byValue (byte): Value to set, subject to validation\n\nReturns:\n- void",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
