      "comment": "Sets emblem icon properties for a unit based on type, color, and mode.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pUnit is non-NULL (assert if invalid)\n2. If nEmblemType in range [1, 32]:\n   a. Build icon resource path using nEmblemType index\n   b. Load emblem icon via Ordinal_10039\n   c. Store icon ID at unit offset 0xBC\n   d. Set color from g_abEmblemColorTable (nEmblemColor 1-10, else 0)\n   e. Set mode from g_abEmblemModeTable (nEmblemMode 1-10, else 0)\n3. Return without changes if nEmblemType is outside valid range\n\nParameters:\n- dwUnit (uint): Unit structure pointer for emblem configuration\n- byEmblemType (byte): Emblem type (1-32, table index minus 1 for icon lookup)\n- byEmblemColor (byte): Emblem color index (0=default, 1-10=use table)\n- byEmblemMode (byte): Emblem mode index (0=default, 1-10=use table)\n\nReturns:\n- void",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:874e1ce316cc152589cd87880e223490",
