      "name": "LoadColorTransformData",
      "signature": "void LoadColorTransformData(char * szPalettePath, int nTransformIndex)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Loads color transform data from file and initializes global transform table.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Read base palette path from global string\n2. Append input palette path to create full path\n3. Append gamma adjustment path to buffer\n4. Validate transform data file using FUN_6f913e1e\n5. If valid, initialize transform table with FUN_6f913efb and FUN_6f913e66\n6. If invalid, clear transform table (0x540 DWORDs) and log warning\n\nParameters:\n- szPalettePath (char*): Palette filename to load\n- nTransformIndex (int): Index into global transform table (multiplies by 0x6900)\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)",
