      "name": "GetCharacterTitleString",
      "signature": "char * GetCharacterTitleString(uint dwCharClass, uint dwTitle, int nFemale)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Returns the title name string for a character class and title combination.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check bFemale flag to select gender-specific title table\n2. Use dwCharClass (0-9) as index into class lookup table\n3. Use dwTitle (1-6) as index into title string lookup\n4. Return corresponding title name string pointer\n\nParameters:\n- dwCharClass (uint): Character class code (0-9)\n- dwTitle (uint): Title rank code (1-6 for standard titles)\n- bFemale (int): Gender flag (0=male titles, non-zero=female titles)\n\nReturns:\n- Pointer to title name string (e.g., \"Dame\", \"Lord\", \"Queen\")\n- Returns default string if parameters out of range",
