      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Releases all items in an inventory list and cleans up the structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate input is inventory type (0xc)\n2. Iterate through linked list at offset 0x40\n3. Release each pool allocation at offset 0x34\n4. Call cleanup routine on inventory structure\n\nParameters:\n- pInventory (void*): Pointer to inventory structure\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xc: Inventory type identifier\n- 0x40: List head offset\n- 0x34: Next pointer offset (linked list stride)",
