      "name": "FindAndRemoveListNode",
      "signature": "bool FindAndRemoveListNode(int * pList, byte * pbSearchValue)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Searches for and removes a node from a linked list by value comparison.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate list structure (check count at offset 0)\n2. Get head node pointer from list offset 0x10\n3. Traverse list comparing node data with search value byte-by-byte\n4. If match found, unlink node from list (update previous->next or head)\n5. Clear tail pointer if removing tail node (offset 0x11)\n6. Deallocate matched node via ReleasePoolAllocation\n7. Return true on match, false if no matching node found\n\nParameters:\n- pList (int*): Pointer to list structure with count at [0], head at [0x10], tail at [0x11]\n- pbSearchValue (byte*): Null-terminated byte sequence to match against node data\n\nReturns:\n- true (1): Node found and removed from list\n- false (0): No matching node found\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x0c: Expected list type identifier for validation\n- 0x10: Offset to head node pointer in list structure\n- 0x11: Offset to tail node pointer in list structure\n- 0x34: Offset to next pointer in node structure",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "API",
      "index": "API:95682e68512dce4fec7ad5d724bae731",
