      "name": "AnimCallbackUpdateState",
      "signature": "int AnimCallbackUpdateState(int * * ppAnimHandle)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "AnimCallbackUpdateState - Invokes animation update callback and manages state transitions.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Dereference ppAnimHandle to get pAnimObj (D2WIN_IMAGE structure)\n2. Assert pAnimObj->eType == 2 (D2WIN_IMAGE type validation)\n3. Check if pAnimObj->pfnUpdateCallback (offset 0x34) is non-null\n4. If null, return 0 (no callback to invoke)\n5. Call pfnUpdateCallback(ppAnimHandle) and capture return value\n6. If callback returns 0, return 0 (no state change needed)\n7. Check current state at pAnimObj->nState (offset 0x50):\n   - If state == 3: transition to state 4\n   - If state == 1: transition to state 2\n   - Otherwise: return callback result unchanged\n8. Clear pAnimObj->nFrameCounter (offset 0x4C) to 0\n9. Store GetTickCount() in pAnimObj->dwLastTick (offset 0x48)\n10. Return callback result\n\nParameters:\n- ppAnimHandle (int**): Double pointer to animation object handle\n\nReturns:\n- int: Result from pfnUpdateCallback, or 0 if no callback\n\nState Transitions:\n- State 1 -> 2: Animation starting -> playing\n- State 3 -> 4: Animation stopping -> stopped\n\nStructure Offsets (D2WIN_IMAGE, size 0x60):\nOffset  Size  Field              Type        Description\n0x00    4     eType              uint        Type marker (must be 2)\n0x34    4     pfnUpdateCallback  code*       Update callback function pointer\n0x48    4     dwLastTick         DWORD       Last update tick count\n0x4C    4     nFrameCounter      int         Frame counter (reset on transition)\n0x50    4     nState             int         Animation state (1-4)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:0f233fdf32b921609890fa9ac07ed9f7",
