      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Sets a value field on an animation image structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pAnim type field equals 2 (IMAGE type)\n2. Assert and abort if type mismatch\n3. Write nValue to structure offset 0x5c (field index 0x17)\n4. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n- pAnim (int*): Pointer to animation/image structure (type must be 2)\n- nValue (int): Value to write at offset 0x5c\n\nReturns:\n- 1: Always on success (asserts on type mismatch)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 2: Expected type for IMAGE structure\n- 0x5c (92): Offset of target data field",
