      "name": "ShowInsertExpansionDiscDialog",
      "signature": "bool ShowInsertExpansionDiscDialog(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Displays a message box requesting the Expansion Disc to be inserted.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calls Ordinal_10027 to get the main application window handle\n2. Prepares message box parameters with \"Insert Expansion Disc\" text\n3. Displays MessageBoxA dialog with MB_YESNO buttons (type 0x31)\n4. Converts button response to boolean: IDYES (1) becomes true, others become false\n5. Returns result to caller\n\nParameters:\n- None (void)\n\nReturns:\n- true (1) if user clicked \"Yes\" to confirm\n- false (0) if user cancelled or clicked \"No\"\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x31: MB_YESNO | MB_ICONEXCLAMATION message box style",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
