      "name": "PromptInsertCinematicsDisc",
      "signature": "bool PromptInsertCinematicsDisc(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Displays a message box prompting the user to insert the Diablo II Cinematics Disc.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calls Ordinal_10027 to get the main window handle\n2. Displays MessageBoxA with the message \"Insert Cinematics Disc\" on the obtained window\n3. Converts the dialog result (IDOK=1) to bool: returns 1 if OK clicked, 0 otherwise\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: Uses hardcoded strings and message box type 0x31 (MB_OKCANCEL | MB_ICONQUESTION)\n\nReturns:\n- true (1) if user clicked OK, false (0) if user clicked Cancel\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x31: Message box type (MB_OKCANCEL | MB_ICONQUESTION)\n- 0x6f920fb8: Address of \"Diablo II\" caption string\n- 0x6f920fd8: Address of \"Insert Cinematics Disc\" message string\n- 0x6f91d330: Address of MessageBoxA import",
