      "name": "InitializeDataMpqs",
      "signature": "int InitializeDataMpqs(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initialize Diablo II MPQ archives and validate expansion files.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load core MPQ files (D2Data, D2SFX, D2Speech, D2Delta, D2KFixup, PatchD2, D2Expansion)\n2. Check if expansion is already active via GetExpansionFlag()\n3. Return 1 (success) if expansion already enabled\n4. Validate all core MPQ files are loaded successfully\n5. If core files loaded, check expansion MPQ file via CheckExpansionMpqExists()\n6. Return 1 if expansion MPQ exists and is available\n7. Return 0 if core files not loaded or expansion validation failed\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: None - function takes no parameters\n\nReturns:\n- 1 on success (expansion ready or already active)\n- 0 if any core MPQ file failed to load or expansion validation failed",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:eb141254335a4fe5d82ae36681fbdd54",
