      "comment": "Closes all loaded Diablo 2 MPQ archives and sets handles to NULL.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Iterate through each open MPQ file pointer (Data, Speech, SFX, Delta, KFixup, Expansion, Patch, and variant MPQ files)\n2. Check if each MPQ pointer is non-NULL\n3. If non-NULL, call close function and set pointer to NULL\n4. Return with all MPQ resources released\n\nParameters:\n- (none) - Function takes no parameters, operates on global MPQ pointers\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FUN_6f9141f6 (MPQ close/cleanup function)",
