      "name": "InitializeMpqFiles",
      "signature": "dword InitializeMpqFiles(char * szPath1, char * szPath2, dword dwFlags, int nExpansionId)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Initialize MPQ file handles for D2 resources (debug, patch, music, expansion).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if expansion flag is set; if so, bypass expansions\n2. Check if expansion MPQ exists\n3. If expansion unavailable or flag set: Load debug and music MPQs with pszPath1\n4. If expansion available: Load all 5 MPQ types (debug, music, override, expansion)\n5. Verify all required MPQs loaded successfully\n6. On failure: Clean up and close all allocated MPQ handles\n\nParameters:\n- pszPath1 (char*): Primary path (base game assets)\n- pszPath2 (char*): Secondary path (expansion assets)\n- dwFlags (dword): Load flags (priority/mode)\n- nExpansionId (int): Expansion version identifier or 0 for base\n\nReturns:\n- 1 on success (all required MPQs loaded)\n- 0 on failure (insufficient MPQs loaded)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
