      "comment": "Closes/releases all open MPQ file handles.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if g_pD2PatchOptMpq handle is open (non-NULL)\n2. If open, close it via CloseMpqArchive and set to NULL\n3. Repeat for g_pD2DebugMpq, g_pD2LocalMpq, g_pD2OverrideMpq, g_pD2CdMpq, g_pD2CdExpMpq\n4. All MPQ handles are cleared to prevent resource leaks\n\nParameters:\n- (none)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nRelated Functions:\n- CloseMpqArchive: MPQ handle close/cleanup function",
