      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Validates button structure state and initialization.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Assert button type is 6 (D2WIN_BUTTON), fail if not\n2. Check if both field_2c and field_30 are non-zero\n3. Return 1 if both set, 0 otherwise\n\nParameters:\n- pButton (D2WinButton*): Pointer to button structure\n\nReturns:\n- 1 (true) if button fields field_2c and field_30 are both initialized\n- 0 (false) if either field is zero or type mismatch\n\nNote:\n- Field offsets +0x2c (+44) and +0x30 (+48) represent button state flags\n- These fields must be initialized for the button to be valid",
