      "name": "SetStructFieldValue",
      "signature": "void SetStructFieldValue(int * pStruct, int nValue)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Sets a field value in a structure after validating the structure type.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate that pStruct[0] == 6 (expected type marker)\n2. If validation fails, assert with debug location info and exit\n3. Set pStruct[0x17] = nValue\n\nParameters:\n- pStruct (int*): Pointer to structure; pStruct[0] must equal 6\n- nValue (int): Value to write to structure offset 0x5c (0x17 in array form)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 6: Expected structure type marker at pStruct[0]\n- 0x5c (92): Target field offset for value assignment",
