      "name": "SwapEditBoxSelection",
      "signature": "void SwapEditBoxSelection(int * pEditBoxData)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Swaps text between edit box selection and clipboard/buffer.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate input pointer and type flag\n2. Initialize two Unicode string buffers (local_400, aUStack_200)\n3. Calculate min/max of selection range bounds\n4. Copy selection range to local_400\n5. Copy replacement text to aUStack_200\n6. Concatenate and update edit box text\n7. Update selection length field\n\nParameters:\n- pEditData (int*): Edit box control data structure\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nRelated: Uses Unicode string operations (strncpy, strcpy, strcat, strlen)",
