      "name": "ConvertCharToUnicodeAndSetEditData",
      "signature": "void ConvertCharToUnicodeAndSetEditData(EditData * pOutput, char * szInput)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Converts an 8-bit character string to Unicode and sets EditData.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Allocate 512-byte Unicode buffer on stack (256 elements)\n2. Initialize each Unicode element with default constructor\n3. Convert input char* string to Unicode via win2Unicode\n4. Pass converted Unicode buffer to EditData_SetString\n\nParameters:\n- pOutput (int*): EditData structure to receive the string\n- szInput (char*): Input 8-bit character string to convert\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nOrdinals:\n- Ordinal_10075 = EditData_SetString (stores Unicode string)\n- Ordinal_10076 = This function\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x100 (256): Loop counter for buffer initialization\n- 0x200 (512): Stack buffer size in bytes",
