      "name": "LinkDoubleLinkedListNodes",
      "signature": "void LinkDoubleLinkedListNodes(int * pPrevNode, int * pNextNode)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Links two nodes in a bidirectional list by updating their cross-pointers.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate that pPrevNode is non-NULL and contains type marker (1)\n2. Validate that pNextNode is non-NULL and contains type marker (1)\n3. Set pPrevNode[0x9e] = pNextNode (forward link)\n4. Set pNextNode[0x9f] = pPrevNode (backward link)\n\nParameters:\n- pPrevNode (int*): Previous node in list; offset 0x9e holds forward pointer\n- pNextNode (int*): Next node in list; offset 0x9f holds backward pointer\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x9e (158): Forward link offset in node structure\n- 0x9f (159): Backward link offset in node structure\n- 1: Type validation marker value",
