      "name": "EditBoxHandleSelection",
      "signature": "uint EditBoxHandleSelection(uint * pEditBox, int nStartX, int nStartY)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Processes text selection in edit box with mouse coordinates validation and text width measurement.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate edit box structure pointer and type flags\n2. Calculate clamped selection bounds from input coordinates and structure limits\n3. Parse text line-by-line, measuring width with Unicode conversion\n4. Find character position within visible width using metric calculations\n5. Update selection start/end fields if Shift key pressed\n6. Invoke callback handler if present (field at offset 0x34)\n\nParameters:\n- pEditBox (uint *): Pointer to edit box structure (in ECX)\n- nStartX (int): X coordinate for selection (in EDX)\n- nStartY (int): Y coordinate for selection (on stack)\n\nReturns:\n- uint: Result from callback invocation, or 0 if no callback present\n\nRelated Functions:\n- EditBoxKeyHandler: Caller that processes keyboard input\n- Ordinal_10012 through Ordinal_10127: Font/text measurement and Unicode utilities",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "API",
      "index": "API:bada6fc843808d6448768d3c878508e4",
