      "comment": "Initialize locale-specific UI and display data tables based on language ID.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get system locale ID via GetLanguageLocaleId()\n2. Initialize global palette and rendering constants per locale\n3. Switch on locale ID to select appropriate string tables\n4. Copy locale-specific font/image paths to working buffers\n5. Load CEL images for fonts and monster indicators\n6. Clear 0x200 dword buffer for rendering cache\n7. Copy locale-specific data strings and convert to Unicode\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: EBX contains context pointer\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x10, 0x11, 0xe, 0xf (palette indices per locale)\n- 0x200 (512 dwords = 2KB buffer for rendering cache)\n- 0x4f (80 chars, sizeof font path buffer)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
