      "name": "MeasureTextWidthWithEscapes",
      "signature": "int MeasureTextWidthWithEscapes(ushort * pData, int nLimit)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Scans and validates a ushort array, accumulating results from matched patterns.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize sum (nSum) and index (nIdx) to 0\n2. Return 0 immediately if input array pointer is null\n3. Set position counter (nPos) to 3\n4. Loop through array until null terminator:\n   - Return accumulated sum if current index exceeds nLimit\n   - If value equals 0x0A (newline), skip and advance all counters\n   - Otherwise validate: value must be 0xFF followed by two digits (0x30-0x36)\n   - If validation fails, call g_pfnValueProcessor and add byte at offset +3 to sum\n   - Advance array pointer, index, and position counters appropriately\n5. Return accumulated sum\n\nParameters:\n- pData (ushort*): Pointer to null-terminated ushort array to process\n- nLimit (int): Maximum index/position limit for array traversal\n\nReturns:\n- int: Accumulated sum based on matched pattern conversions from g_pfnValueProcessor",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:0d1434131d4fb3766389fdedd1ca557f",
