      "name": "SumCharacterValues",
      "signature": "int SumCharacterValues(short * pText)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Sums character values from a Unicode string.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get string length via Unicode::strlen()\n2. Iterate through each character in the string\n3. Skip newline characters (0x000A)\n4. For each other character, call g_pfnValueProcessor() to get character value\n5. Add the low byte (offset +3) of the returned value to the running sum\n6. Return total sum\n\nParameters:\n- lpwszText (Unicode*): Pointer to null-terminated Unicode string\n\nReturns:\n- Sum of character values (excluding newlines)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- g_pfnValueProcessor: Function pointer used to process each character\n- Unicode::strlen: String length calculation",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:38c956cb374337d5ce3cfaddd6605abe",
