      "name": "CalcUnicodeStringWidth",
      "signature": "int CalcUnicodeStringWidth(Unicode * pStr)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Calculates the width in pixels of a Unicode string, handling color codes.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate input string is not NULL\n2. Iterate through each character in string until newline (0x0A)\n3. If character is 0xFF (color code prefix), skip next 4 bytes and call value processor\n4. Otherwise, call value processor for normal character\n5. Accumulate width values from value processor\n6. Return total width\n\nParameters:\n- pStr (Unicode*): Pointer to null-terminated Unicode string\n\nReturns:\n- int: Total calculated width in pixels",
