      "signature": "void InitializeStringBuffer(Unicode * pszInputStr, dword dwMaxWidth, dword dwBaseHeight, dword dwOutputValue, dword dwAlignMode)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Initializes global string buffer with input string or clears if invalid.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if input string is null or length exceeds 0x3FF (1023)\n2. If invalid, clear entire buffer with 0x200 (512) dwords\n3. Otherwise copy input string to global buffer\n4. Set global configuration: max width, base height, output value, alignment mode\n\nParameters:\n- pszInputStr (Unicode*): Input string or NULL\n- dwMaxWidth (dword): Maximum width value\n- dwBaseHeight (dword): Base height value\n- dwOutputValue (dword): Output value setting\n- dwAlignMode (dword): Alignment mode flags\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x3FF (1023): Maximum input string length\n- 0x200 (512): Buffer size in dwords (2048 bytes)",
