      "name": "CheckBitFlagIndex",
      "signature": "uint CheckBitFlagIndex(byte byCheck)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Returns bit flag indicating whether byCheck index is valid in the global bit flags array.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if byCheck is 0xFF (special invalid case)\n2. If byCheck >> 5 is less than 8, extract and return bit at position (byCheck & 0x1F) from g_dwBitFlags[byCheck >> 5]\n3. Otherwise, fail assertion and call fatal error handler\n\nParameters:\n- byCheck (byte): Index to check validity in bit flags\n\nReturns:\n- 1 if bit is set at index position, 0 if clear\n- Does not return on invalid index (calls FUN_6f91436d)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:6ebe5979fc54a65e5345d36f4396483b",
