      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Releases all pooled allocations from a list structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate input list type matches expected value (7)\n2. Iterate linked list starting at offset 0x64 (0x19 * 4)\n3. For each node, read next pointer from offset 0x220\n4. Call ReleasePoolAllocation to free each node\n5. Notify completion to parent cleanup function\n\nParameters:\n- pListData (int*): Pointer to list structure, first element must be 7\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x7: Expected list type validation constant\n- 0x64 (100): List head node offset\n- 0x220 (544): Linked list node offset to next pointer\n- 0x80: Validation error code flag",
