      "name": "ConvertCharToUnicodeAndProcess",
      "signature": "void ConvertCharToUnicodeAndProcess(int * pnCodes, char * szBuffer, dword nMaxCount, void * param4, dword nUnknown, dword nParam6, dword nParam7)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Converts ASCII string to Unicode and processes with Ordinal_10137.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Allocate 512-element Unicode array on stack\n2. Initialize each Unicode element via constructor\n3. Convert input ASCII string to Unicode using win2Unicode\n4. Call Ordinal_10137 with converted string and parameters\n\nParameters:\n- pnCodes (int*): Code/context pointer (ECX)\n- szBuffer (char*): ASCII string to convert (EDX)\n- nMaxCount (uint): Max conversion count (0x100/256)\n- param4 (Unicode): Unicode parameter\n- nUnknown (uint): Unknown parameter\n- nParam6 (int): Unknown parameter\n- nParam7 (int): Unknown parameter\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x100 (256): Max Unicode conversion count\n- 0x200 (512): Stack-allocated Unicode array size",
