      "name": "ListAddItem",
      "signature": "void ListAddItem(int * pList, Unicode * pszStr, uint dwFlags, byte byChar, uint dwType, int nInsertPos, int nSelect)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Adds a new item to a list, allocating and initializing its structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pList type field equals 7 (D2WIN_LIST type)\n2. Set font via SetActiveFont (Ordinal_10127)\n3. Allocate 0x224 bytes for new item structure\n4. Validate string length < 0x100 chars; copy pszStr to structure\n5. Measure string dimensions and update list max width if needed\n6. Store dwType, dwFlags, byChar in new item\n7. Link item into list: if nInsertPos==0 append to tail, else insert at head\n8. Increment list item count and set selection if nSelect flag set\n\nParameters:\n- pList (int *): Pointer to list structure (validated type=7 at offset 0x10)\n- pszStr (Unicode *): Item text string to add\n- dwFlags (uint): Item flags (stored at offset 0x204)\n- byChar (byte): Item character attribute (stored at offset 0x218)\n- dwType (uint): Item type value (stored at offset 0x21c)\n- nInsertPos (int): 0=append to tail, else=insert at head\n- nSelect (int): Non-zero=set as selected item (offset 0x1a)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x224: Size of list item structure\n- 0x100: Maximum string length (256 chars)\n- 0x7: D2WIN_LIST type constant\n\nRelated Functions:\n- SetActiveFont (Ordinal_10127): Sets font before string measurement",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
