      "name": "FindListNodeIndex",
      "signature": "int FindListNodeIndex(int * pListData)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Finds the index of a target node in a linked list structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validates that pListData is a list object (eType == 7)\n2. Gets the head node pointer from pListData[0x19]\n3. Iterates through linked list nodes (stride 0x220 bytes)\n4. Counts nodes until finding one matching pListData[0x1a]\n5. Returns the count or -1 if target not found\n\nParameters:\n- pListData (int*): Pointer to D2WIN_LIST structure with eType, head, and target node\n\nReturns:\n- Index of matching node (0-based), or -1 if not found",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
