      "name": "InitializeApplicationDisplay",
      "signature": "int InitializeApplicationDisplay(int nWidth)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initializes the application display and graphics system.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Store width parameter to global display width\n2. Initialize message queues\n3. Resize window by calling Ordinal_10030\n4. If resize failed, log error and exit\n5. Initialize graphics system with memory allocation\n6. Return success (1)\n\nParameters:\n- nWidth (int): Desired window width in pixels\n\nReturns:\n- 1 on success, never returns on failure (calls exit)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
