      "name": "TestChildBitFlags",
      "signature": "dword TestChildBitFlags(void * pChild)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Tests if a child structure contains specific bit flags using global bitmask.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pChild pointer is not NULL (assertion failure if NULL)\n2. Load global bitmask from gdwBitMasks_exref table at offset 8\n3. Load flags from child structure at offset 8\n4. Return bitwise AND of mask and flags\n\nParameters:\n- pChild (void*): Pointer to child structure containing flag bits at offset +8\n\nReturns:\n- Non-zero if matching bits detected, zero otherwise\n\nNotes:\n- Ordinal 10026 export\n- Terminates process via FogAssert if pChild is NULL",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
