      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Wrapper that enables cookie-based caching before inserting a cache node.\n\nClassification: Thunk/Wrapper - wraps InsertCacheNodeWithCookie with pre-set flag\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set global g_fCookieCacheEnabled flag to 1 (enabled)\n2. Call InsertCacheNodeWithCookie with the cookie value\n3. Return (flag remains set for subsequent cache operations)\n\nParameters:\n  dwCookieValue (uint, Stack[0x4]) - Cookie value to associate with the cache node\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nRelated Functions:\n  InsertCacheNodeWithCookieDisabled (0x6f90f520) - Sets flag to 0 before insert\n  FUN_6f90f940 - Reads g_fCookieCacheEnabled to control cookie processing\n\nGlobal State Modified:\n  g_fCookieCacheEnabled (0x6f961550) - Set to 1 to enable cookie-based caching",
