      "name": "InsertCacheNodeBypassingCache",
      "signature": "uint InsertCacheNodeBypassingCache(uint dwCookieValue)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Inserts a cache node while bypassing the cookie cache mechanism.\n\nClassification: Wrapper function - wraps InsertCacheNodeWithCookie with cache disable\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Disable cookie caching by setting g_fCookieCacheEnabled = 0\n2. Call InsertCacheNodeWithCookie with the provided cookie value\n3. Return result from InsertCacheNodeWithCookie\n\nParameters:\n  dwCookieValue (uint) - Cookie identifier to insert into cache\n\nReturns:\n  uint - Result from InsertCacheNodeWithCookie (cache node insertion status)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Cache remains disabled after this call (caller responsibility to re-enable)\n  - No validation of dwCookieValue performed\n\nMemory Model:\n  - Modifies global g_fCookieCacheEnabled (sets to 0)\n  - Does not restore original cache state\n\nCross-References:\n  - Calls: InsertCacheNodeWithCookie\n  - Writes: g_fCookieCacheEnabled (0x6f961550)",
