      "name": "ComparePaletteBuffers",
      "signature": "uint ComparePaletteBuffers(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Compares two palette buffers and returns comparison result.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize two 260-byte palette buffers\n2. Load palette data into both buffers via FUN_6f914ae4\n3. Compare buffers using FUN_6f90ff10\n4. Update palette reference via Ordinal_10048\n5. Return comparison result\n\nParameters:\n- None (uses global palette data g_pPaletteData)\n\nReturns:\n- Result of palette comparison (1=match, 0=mismatch or error)",
