      "comment": "Initializes or disables application cleanup timer and palette refresh.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check enable flag\n2. If enabled: set timer globals, record current tick count, enable cleanup\n3. If disabled: disable timer and cleanup flags\n4. Call palette cleanup handler in both cases\n\nParameters:\n- fEnable (bool): Enable (non-zero) or disable (zero) cleanup timer\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nRelated Functions:\n- Ordinal_10048: Palette data cleanup handler\n- GetTickCount: Windows API for elapsed time",
