      "name": "InitActPalette",
      "signature": "void InitActPalette(int nAct, uint dwParam2)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initialize palette and color transformation tables.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If nAct == 0: Use default ACT1 palette files\n   - Build path to palette .act and .pl2 files in DATA_GLOBAL\n   - Load palette data and initialize transform tables\n2. If nAct != 0: Use provided buffer pointers\n   - Load palette data from nAct and dwParam2 buffers\n   - Initialize color transformation lookup tables\n\nParameters:\n- nAct (int): Act ID or pointer to palette buffer (0 = default ACT1)\n- dwParam2 (uint): Pointer to palette data buffer or palette param\n\nReturns:\n- 1 (always succeeds)",
