      "name": "RenderPopupContent",
      "signature": "int RenderPopupContent(int * pPopupData)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Renders popup menu content with multiple text lines and selection highlighting.\nCalled as a callback from the screen object event system at offset 0x1C.\n\nNOTE: Function boundary is broken (single instruction detected). Variable types and\nnames documented here but cannot be applied via MCP tools until boundary is fixed.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate object type is 0xB (D2WIN_POPUP) via FogAssert\n2. Check visibility flags in gdwBitMasks (bits at offset +0 and +8)\n3. If not visible, return 0 (not handled)\n4. Find palette index for gray color (0x3F, 0x3F, 0x3F) for background\n5. Calculate background rectangle bounds from popup dimensions with 5px padding\n6. Draw semi-transparent background via Ordinal_10052 (D2Gfx.DrawFilledRect)\n7. Validate clip coordinates via GfxValidateClipCoordinates\n8. Set active font to index 1\n9. Loop through all text lines (count at offset 0x40):\n   a. Get text pointer from popup+0x44 (0x84 bytes per line)\n   b. Calculate Y position: baseY + ((lineIndex - lineCount) + 1) * 0x14\n   c. Determine text color: 3 if selected (matches offset 0x464), 0 otherwise\n   d. Call RenderUnicodeTextWithLineHeight for each line\n10. Return 1 (handled)\n\nParameters:\n- pPopupData (ECX): Pointer to popup structure (type 0xB)\n  [0x00] eType: Object type constant 0xB\n  [0x08] dwFlags: Visibility/interaction flags\n  [0x0C] nY: Top Y coordinate\n  [0x10] nX: Left X coordinate\n  [0x14] nHeight: Popup height\n  [0x18] nWidth: Popup width\n  [0x40] nLineCount: Number of text lines\n  [0x44] szLines[]: Unicode text lines (0x84 bytes each = 66 wchar_t)\n  [0x464] nSelectedLine: Currently highlighted line index (-1 if none)\n\nReturns:\n- 1: Popup was visible and rendered\n- 0: Popup not visible (flags not set)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xB: D2WIN_POPUP object type constant\n- 0x14 (20): Line height in pixels\n- 0x84 (132): Bytes per text line (66 wchar_t)\n- 0x3F: Gray color component (63/255)\n- 0xFF: Alpha value for background rectangle\n- 5: Padding pixels around popup content\n\nOrdinal Calls:\n- Ordinal_10052: D2Gfx.DrawFilledRect - Draws filled rectangle with alpha\n\nVariable Mapping (cannot rename due to broken boundary):\n- uVar1 -> byPaletteIndex (byte): Palette index for gray background color\n- iVar2 -> nLineCount (int): Number of text lines from offset 0x40\n- iVar3 -> nLineIndex (int): Loop counter for rendering text lines\n- pszText -> pwszLineText (Unicode*): Pointer to current Unicode text line\n- unaff_ESI, unaff_EBX: Phantom registers from decompiler (ignore)\n- iStack_10..iStack_4: Background rectangle coordinates (nTop, nBottom, nLeft, nRight)",
