      "name": "SmackInitialize",
      "signature": "int SmackInitialize(int * pSmackContext, char * szFilePath)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initialize SMACK video playback context with given filename.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate that context type field equals 9 (SMACK type identifier)\n2. Copy filename to context file buffer at offset +0x10 (max 0x100 bytes)\n3. Initialize audio subsystem at context offset +0x50\n4. Configure playback parameters at context offset +0x50 using filename\n5. Store filename in global g_szSmackFilename (0x104 bytes)\n6. Cache first character of filename in global g_bySmackFileChar\n\nParameters:\n- pSmackContext (int*): Pointer to SMACK playback context structure\n- szFilePath (char*): Path to SMACK video file\n\nReturns:\n- 1 on success\n- Does not return on validation failure (calls FUN_6f91436d with 0xFFFFFFFF)",
