      "signature": "int SetSmackPosition(int * pSmackData, int nX, int nY)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Sets position values for a Smacker video structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Assert structure type equals 9 (SMACK type)\n2. Copy nX to offsets 0xc and 0x148\n3. Copy nY to offsets 0x10 and 0x14c\n4. Return 1 on success\n\nParameters:\n- pSmackData (int*): Pointer to Smacker data structure\n- nX (int): X position value\n- nY (int): Y position value\n\nReturns:\n- 1: Always returns 1 after type validation passes\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 9: Smacker structure type identifier\n- 0xc/0x148: X position field offsets (primary/secondary)\n- 0x10/0x14c: Y position field offsets (primary/secondary)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
