      "name": "ConvertStringToUnicode",
      "signature": "void ConvertStringToUnicode(int * pData, char * szString)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Converts an ASCII string to Unicode format and processes it.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate that pData is not NULL (assert failure if NULL)\n2. Initialize a 512-element Unicode buffer on the stack\n3. Convert ASCII string from pszString to Unicode using win2Unicode (0x100 chars)\n4. Pass the Unicode buffer and pointer to Ordinal_10051 for further processing\n\nParameters:\n- pData (int*): Pointer to data structure (passed to Ordinal_10051)\n- pszString (char*): Pointer to ASCII string to convert\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x100 (256): Character count limit for conversion\n- 0x200 (512): Stack buffer size (256 Unicode chars * 2 bytes)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
