      "name": "StringAsciiToUnicode",
      "signature": "void StringAsciiToUnicode(int * pBuffer, char * szSource, uint dwMaxLen)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Converts an ASCII string to Unicode representation (UTF-16).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize a 512-Unicode element buffer (1024 bytes) on the stack\n2. Fill buffer with default constructors (zeros)\n3. Assert param_1 is not NULL\n4. Call win2Unicode to convert ASCII pszSource to Unicode\n5. Call Ordinal_10051 (likely wide string handler) with converted string\n\nParameters:\n- pBuffer (int*): Output buffer pointer (destination for result)\n- pszSource (char*): Source ASCII string to convert\n- dwMaxLen (uint): Maximum length (256 elements, or 0x100)\n\nReturns:\n- void (result stored in param_1 buffer)",
