      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Sets a text string at a specific line and column in a text data structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate ptTextData pointer is not null\n2. Check that ptTextData type is 4 (text type marker)\n3. Validate column index does not exceed max columns\n4. Initialize local buffer with Unicode default constructors\n5. Copy input text to local buffer\n6. Navigate linked list to find target line (skip nLine nodes)\n7. Allocate memory for new text string entry\n8. Copy buffer to allocated memory and link to column entry\n9. Return success (1)\n\nParameters:\n- ptTextData (int *): Pointer to text data structure in ECX\n- szText (Unicode *): Input text string to store in EDX\n- nLine (int): Line index to target (stack param 1)\n- nColumn (int): Column index within line (stack param 2)\n\nReturns:\n- 1 on success (text set and linked)\n- Asserts if data structure validation fails (no return on error)",
