      "name": "ScrollbarNavigateToIndex",
      "signature": "int ScrollbarNavigateToIndex(int * pScrollbar, int nIndex)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Navigate linked list to specified index and update scrollbar fields.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pScrollbar pointer is not null (assert failure if null)\n2. Validate first field contains value 4 (type check for D2WIN_TEXTBOX)\n3. Clamp nIndex to maximum stored at offset 0x15\n4. Walk linked list from offset 0x12, following pointers at offset 0x1c\n5. Store result pointer at offset 0x14 and index at offset 0x16\n6. Update scrollbar display via ScrollbarSetValue if scrollbar exists\n\nParameters:\n- pScrollbar (int*): Scrollbar structure pointer\n- nIndex (int): Target index to navigate to\n\nReturns:\n- 1: Always returns success after navigation\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x12: Offset to head of linked list in scrollbar struct\n- 0x14: Offset to current item pointer\n- 0x15: Offset to maximum index\n- 0x16: Offset to current index\n- 0x1c: Offset to next pointer in list node\n- 0x24: Offset to scrollbar display control",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "API",
      "index": "API:8176347c27090d68d773d0e3d0454e28",
