      "name": "GetItemByIndex",
      "signature": "dword GetItemByIndex(int * pItemNode)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Retrieves item from list by index.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate input pointer (must be non-null)\n2. Check item type field equals 4\n3. Verify index counter exists (offset 0x18) and flag bit set (offset 0x5c:0)\n4. Iterate linked list at offset 0x48, comparing index counter\n5. Return matching element, or 0 if not found\n\nParameters:\n- pItemNode (int *): Pointer to item structure (ECX), contains type and list pointers\n\nReturns:\n- Item value (uint) at index, or 0 if not found or invalid type",
