      "name": "GetChildNodeCount",
      "signature": "int GetChildNodeCount(int * pNode)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Count child nodes in a linked list structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate input pointer is non-null; assert and terminate if null\n2. Check node type field at offset 0 equals 4; assert if not equal\n3. Load child list head pointer from offset 0x48\n4. Initialize counter to 0\n5. Loop while child pointer is non-null:\n   - Load next child from offset 0x1c of current child\n   - Increment counter if next child is non-null\n6. Return final count\n\nParameters:\n- pNode (int*): Pointer to node structure with type field at offset 0, child list at offset 0x48, next pointer at offset 0x1c\n\nReturns:\n- Count of child nodes in the linked list",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
