      "comment": "Initializes scrollbar height and related properties.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validates pScrollbar pointer (assert on NULL)\n2. Validates structure type at offset 0 equals 4\n3. Retrieves scrollbar height from offset 0x24\n4. Calls GetScrollbarHeight with the height value\n\nParameters:\n- pScrollbar (int*): Pointer to scrollbar structure; must be non-NULL and have type 4 at offset 0\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x4: Expected type value for scrollbar structures\n- 0x24 (36): Offset to scrollbar height field\n- 0x90 (144): Offset to scrollbar dimension or state field",
