      "signature": "void SetControlScrollbarValue(Control * pControl, int nValue)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Sets the scrollbar value for a control structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate that pControl is not NULL\n2. Validate that the control type field (*pControl == 4)\n3. Extract the scrollbar pointer from offset 0x24\n4. Call SetScrollbarValue to update the scrollbar with new value\n5. Return\n\nParameters:\n- pControl (Control*): Pointer to control structure containing scrollbar reference\n- nValue (int): New scrollbar position value to set\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x24 (36): Offset of scrollbar pointer within Control structure\n- 4: Expected control type identifier for scrollbar controls\n\nRelated Functions:\n- SetScrollbarValue: Called to perform actual scrollbar update",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
