      "comment": "Validates text data structure and retrieves scrollbar field.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Assert pTextData is not NULL\n2. Assert structure type marker equals 4 (D2WIN_TEXTBOX type)\n3. Get scrollbar field at offset 0x14 from nested structure at offset 0x90\n\nParameters:\n- pTextData (int*): Text data structure, eType must equal 4\n\nReturns:\n- void (scrollbar field value discarded)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x4: D2WIN_TEXTBOX type marker\n- 0x24 (36): Dword index to scrollbar pointer (0x90/4)\n- 0x90 (144): Byte offset to scrollbar structure",
