      "name": "ProcessDataEntries",
      "signature": "void ProcessDataEntries(void * pThis, int * pData, dword nCount)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Processes array of data entries, iterating through count.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pThis is not null (assertion failure if null)\n2. If count is 0, return without processing\n3. For each entry in pData array (12-byte stride):\n   - Extract 3 pointers: piEntry[-1], *piEntry, piEntry[1]\n   - Call Ordinal_10020 with pThis and extracted pointers\n   - Advance to next entry (12 bytes)\n   - Decrement count\n\nParameters:\n- pThis (void*): Context pointer, validated via assertion\n- pData (int*): Pointer to array of data entries (12-byte stride)\n- nCount (dword): Number of entries to process\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x4d (77): Assertion line number\n- 0xc (12): Entry stride (3 dwords per entry)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "API",
