      "name": "CloseFileHandleIfValid",
      "signature": "void CloseFileHandleIfValid(int nUnused, int nFile)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Validates and closes a file handle, asserting on invalid handle.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Move EDX (hFile) into ECX for validation\n2. Test if hFile is non-zero\n3. If hFile is zero, call FogAssert to log error and terminate\n4. Otherwise, close the file handle via CloseFileHandle\n\nParameters:\n- nUnused (int): Unused parameter, passed in ECX\n- hFile (int): File handle to close\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nRelated Functions:\n- CloseFileHandle: Performs actual file closure\n- FogAssert: Assertion function for error handling",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
