      "name": "ReadTransformData",
      "signature": "void ReadTransformData(int nUnused, int nFile, void * pbDest, int nBytes)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Reads transform data from file and validates byte count.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate hFile is not zero (assertion)\n2. Call ReadFileAsync to read dwBytes from hFile into pbDest buffer\n3. Call GetKeyValue to extract key value into local buffer\n4. Validate key value (assertion)\n5. Compare original dwBytes with bytes actually read\n6. Assert if byte counts don't match\n\nParameters:\n- nUnused (int): Unused parameter (always 0)\n- hFile (int): File handle to read from\n- pbDest (void*): Destination buffer for transform data\n- dwBytes (int): Number of bytes to read (0x1500)\n\nReturns:\n- void (returns via exit assertion on error)",
