      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Load file data asynchronously and allocate buffer for processed content.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Open async file handle and validate async file record\n2. Validate config entry for data type\n3. Allocate buffer (entry size + 800 bytes)\n4. Process and load data from file into buffer\n5. Close file handle\n6. Return allocated buffer or NULL on failure\n\nParameters:\n- nDataType (int): Data type identifier (palette, image, etc.)\n- dwAsyncHandle (dword): Async file handle\n- pOutSize (int *): Output pointer for data size\n- szFilePath (char *): File path string\n- dwFlags (dword): Processing flags\n\nReturns:\n- void *: Allocated buffer with loaded data, or NULL on allocation failure",
