      "calling_convention": "__thiscall",
      "comment": "Attempts to open a Storm archive file with fallback to module directory.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set flags to 2 (or 3 if dwFlags non-zero)\n2. Copy filename to buffer and attempt open\n3. If fails, get module directory, append filename, retry\n4. If still fails, call FUN_6f914163 for alternative handling\n5. Return archive handle or zero\n\nParameters:\n- pBuffer (void*): Path buffer (will contain attempted paths)\n- szFilename (LPCSTR): Filename to open\n- dwUnused (dword): Unused/reserved parameter\n- phArchive (HANDLE*): Output archive handle\n- dwFlags (dword): Flag (0=standard, non-zero=flag 3)\n\nReturns:\n- Archive handle in phArchive, or 0 on final failure",
