      "name": "UpdateTimeCache",
      "signature": "void UpdateTimeCache(int * pnLocalSecond)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Synchronize and cache system time information with timezone awareness.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Fetch local and system times via Windows API\n2. Check if system time has changed since last cache update\n3. If unchanged, skip timezone check and proceed to local time conversion\n4. If changed, query timezone information to detect daylight saving time\n5. Store current system time fields and DST flag in global cache\n6. Convert local time to epoch seconds, optionally applying DST adjustment\n\nParameters:\n- pnLocalSecond (int*): Optional output buffer for epoch time value\n\nReturns:\n- void (result written to *pnLocalSecond if non-NULL)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xffffffff: GetTimeZoneInformation error code\n- 2: Standard + DST zone type (DYNAMIC_TZ_BIAS)\n- Global DAT_6f9cdc00-0x0c: Cached system time (year, month, day, hour, minute, second, ms)\n- Global DAT_6f9cdbf8: Cached DST state (-1=error, 1=active, 0=inactive)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:a6419fbc680afe2a2527cf739cc17f89",
