      "name": "IsCharacterTransformable",
      "signature": "dword IsCharacterTransformable(void * this, void * pContext, dword nCharCode)",
      "calling_convention": "__thiscall",
      "comment": "Determines if a character code requires transformation in Unicode string processing.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If transformation mode (g_dwCharacterTransformMode > 1), delegate to specialized handler\n2. Otherwise, check bit 0x8 in character mapping table for the given code point\n3. Return 1 if bit is set (transformation needed), 0 otherwise\n\nParameters:\n- pContext (void*): Transformation context pointer passed to delegate function\n- nCharCode (uint): Character code to check (validated < 0x100 in callers)\n\nReturns:\n- 1 if character needs transformation, 0 if not\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x1 (1): Comparison threshold for transformation mode\n- 0x8: Bit mask for character transformation flag\n- 0x100: Maximum character code (Latin-1 range)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
