      "comment": "Cleanup buffer state after processing operations.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize pbWork and pbTemp pointers to pbBuffer\n2. Set dwFlags to 0x42\n3. Initialize nCount to maximum (0x7fffffff)\n4. Call processor function with buffer references\n5. Decrement nCount; if negative, call cleanup handler\n6. Otherwise, clear first byte of buffer\n\nParameters:\n- pbBuffer (uint*): Pointer to buffer to process\n- pbMode (byte*): Mode/option byte for processing\n\nReturns:\n- int: Result code from processor function",
