      "name": "AcquireCriticalSectionIndex",
      "signature": "void AcquireCriticalSectionIndex(dword nIndex)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Acquire critical section by index, initializing if necessary.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate pointer to critical section entry in global array\n2. Check if already initialized; if yes, enter and return\n3. Allocate memory for CRITICAL_SECTION structure (0x18 bytes)\n4. If allocation fails, exit with error code 0x11\n5. Lock initialization via AcquireCriticalSectionIndex(0x11) (recursive)\n6. Initialize critical section if still null\n7. Unlock initialization via FUN_6f914e7d(0x11)\n8. Enter the critical section\n\nParameters:\n- nIndex (uint): Index into global critical section array (0x11 is special init lock)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FUN_6f914e7d: Release critical section lock",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
