      "name": "ConvertCharacter",
      "signature": "uint ConvertCharacter(uint dwInput)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Converts a character using either simple ASCII uppercase-to-lowercase conversion or a complex lookup-based conversion.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if g_dwStringCompareMode is 0 (simple conversion mode)\n2. If simple mode and input is uppercase letter (0x41-0x5A), return input + 0x20 (convert to lowercase)\n3. If complex mode, acquire semaphore/critical section 0x13\n4. Call FUN_6f914f01 for character conversion lookup\n5. Release critical section and decrement semaphore count\n6. Return converted character value\n\nParameters:\n- chInput (uint): Character code to convert\n\nReturns:\n- uint: Converted character code",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
