      "name": "TransformCharacterCase",
      "signature": "dword TransformCharacterCase(void * this, void * pThis, dword nChar)",
      "calling_convention": "__thiscall",
      "comment": "Transforms character case based on global character transformation mode.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check g_dwStringCompareMode for transformation strategy\n2. If mode 0 (ASCII): Convert uppercase A-Z (0x41-0x5A) to lowercase by adding 0x20\n3. If mode > 0: Check character code against 0x100 threshold\n4. For chars < 0x100, check g_dwCharacterTransformMode:\n   - If < 2: Use lookup in g_pCharacterTransformTable at offset param*2\n   - If >= 2: Call FUN_6f91508e for transformation\n5. If transformable, extract high/low bytes and apply table flag 0x80\n6. Call FUN_6f917328 to perform full string comparison transformation\n7. Extract result byte(s) from comparison and mask appropriately\n\nParameters:\n- pThis (void*): Context pointer (ECX register, __thiscall)\n- nChar (dword): Character code to transform (0x0-0x10000)\n\nReturns:\n- dword: Transformed character value (8-16 bits used, upper bits 0)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:cc0e19248bdb90cb6bf790db102f9ddf",
