      "name": "CalculateItemSlotPosition",
      "signature": "int CalculateItemSlotPosition(int nCharCode, int nEquipSlot, int nBaseOffset, int nRow, int nCol, int nPageOffset, int nCopyMode)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Calculates the memory position of an item slot for display/storage.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate nCharCode is in valid range (0x76c - 0x7f6)\n2. Look up base offset for equipment slot from table at DAT_6f9221f4\n3. Apply slot alignment adjustment if nCharCode is 4-byte aligned and nEquipSlot > 2\n4. Calculate position as (nRow + (slot offset * 0x18)) * 0x3c + nCol, then * 0x3c\n5. Add base table offset (DAT_6f922110 + 0x7c558180 + nPageOffset)\n6. If nCopyMode==1 or copy verification succeeds, add DAT_6f922118 offset\n\nParameters:\n- nCharCode (int): Character/item code to validate (0x76c-0x7f6 range)\n- nEquipSlot (int): Equipment slot index for lookup table\n- nBaseOffset (int): Base offset to add to table value\n- nRow (int): Row coordinate for position calculation\n- nCol (int): Column coordinate for position calculation\n- nPageOffset (int): Page/view offset value\n- nCopyMode (int): 1=copy mode enabled, -1=conditional copy, other=normal\n\nReturns:\n- Calculated position value (typically memory offset), or -1 if nCharCode is invalid",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:9c858eb5fe1ec691a02f47fae502b1b8",
