      "name": "BufferWriteByteWithCount",
      "signature": "void BufferWriteByteWithCount(dword byValue, int * pnByteCount, int * pnErrorCount)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Writes a byte to a buffer and tracks the byte count.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Decrement byteCount to check if space available\n2. If count < 0: Call BufferWriteByte (buffer full)\n3. Else: Write byte directly to buffer and increment buffer pointer\n4. Check for error (0xffffffff) and update error counter\n\nParameters:\n- byValue (dword): Byte value to write (0-255)\n- pnByteCount (int*): Pointer to buffer position/available count\n- pnErrorCount (int*): Pointer to error/written count tracker\n\nReturns:\n- void",
