      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Writes a sequence of bytes to a buffer, checking for errors.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Loop while nCount > 0\n2. Decrement nCount\n3. Read byte from pbSrc and advance pointer\n4. Call BufferWriteByteWithCount to write byte\n5. Exit if result indicates error (pnResult == -1)\n\nParameters:\n- pbSrc (char*): Source bytes to write\n- nCount (int): Number of bytes to write\n- pdwBuffer (int*): Buffer pointer for output\n- pnResult (int*): Result counter, set to -1 on error\n\nReturns:\n- void (modifies pdwBuffer and pnResult by reference)",
