      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Extracts and advances a 64-bit value from a va_arg list.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load the argument offset pointer from stack parameter\n2. Retrieve the current offset value from the pointer\n3. Extract the 8-byte value at (offset - 8)\n4. Increment the offset by 8 bytes\n5. Return the extracted 64-bit value in EDX:EAX\n\nParameters:\n- pArgOffset (int*): Pointer to current argument offset counter\n  Incremented by 8 after extraction for next va_arg call\n\nReturns:\n- 64-bit unsigned value (ulonglong) at current va_arg position",
