      "comment": "Extract wide character from va_list, advancing pointer by 4 bytes.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load pointer from pVaList parameter\n2. Increment the value at that pointer by 4 (advance va_list)\n3. Extract upper 16 bits of new value and lower 16 bits from offset -4\n4. Return combined 32-bit value\n\nParameters:\n- pVaList (int*): Pointer to va_list pointer (modified by function)\n\nReturns:\n- dword: Extracted value combining upper 16 bits of current and lower 16 bits of previous value\n\nRelated: SprintfxVa (caller), wide character format specifier processing",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:42dbe7ade19c5b9c81e427c9077693e7",
