      "name": "InitializeProcessorCache",
      "signature": "void InitializeProcessorCache(void * pContext)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Initializes processor cache and memory management subsystem.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Invoke cache configuration routine with context pointer\n2. Pass cache block size constant (0x10000)\n3. Pass cache range limit constant (0x30000)\n4. Configure processor memory optimization settings\n\nParameters:\n- pContext (void*): Processor context structure, passed via ECX register for __fastcall\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x10000 (65536): Cache block/page size in bytes\n- 0x30000 (196608): Cache range limit for memory management",
