      "name": "CheckCycleModuloThreshold",
      "signature": "int CheckCycleModuloThreshold(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Checks if the modulo remainder of dividend exceeds threshold.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load divisor from global\n2. Load dividend from global\n3. Compute (dividend / divisor) * divisor to get quotient product\n4. Subtract from dividend to compute remainder\n5. Compare remainder against threshold from global\n6. Return 1 if remainder < threshold, 0 otherwise\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: g_dDivisor - divisor for modulo operation\n- IMPLICIT: g_dDividend - dividend value\n- IMPLICIT: g_dCycleThreshold - threshold for comparison\n\nReturns:\n- 1 if (dividend % divisor) < threshold\n- 0 otherwise",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:49e318c9f11868b2ccda0cc5be0e6fb1",
