      "name": "TransformStringCharacters",
      "signature": "void TransformStringCharacters(char * szString)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Transforms and swaps characters in a string using conversion table.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Convert first character to determine if any transformation needed\n2. If transformation required, iterate through string characters\n3. For each character, check transformation mode and apply conversion rules\n4. Once done, perform reverse swap starting with global swap byte value\n5. Swap characters from start until null terminator reached\n\nParameters:\n- szString (char*): Pointer to string to transform and swap\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x65: Character value for 'e' (transformation check)\n- 0x4: Transform flags bit mask\n- 0x2: Stride in character transformation table",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
