      "comment": "Converts a double-precision float to a decimal string representation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extracts sign bit and exponent from the double value\n2. Formats the significant digits into a buffer with proper padding\n3. Appends null terminator to the output string\n4. Returns the formatted buffer pointer\n\nParameters:\n- pdValue (double*): Pointer to the double value to convert\n- pszBuffer (char*): Output buffer for the decimal string\n- nSize (size_t): Size of the output buffer\n\nReturns:\n- Pointer to pszBuffer containing the formatted decimal string",
