      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Inserts space at offset by shifting string contents.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if offset is non-zero\n2. Get length of source string (including null terminator)\n3. Copy string and terminator from source to offset position\n\nParameters:\n- pszBuffer (char*): Null-terminated string buffer with space at offset\n- nOffset (int): Byte offset to insert at\n\nReturns:\n- void",
