      "name": "GetThreadLocalStorage",
      "signature": "DWORD * GetThreadLocalStorage(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Acquires or initializes thread-local storage for the current thread.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Save current error code to restore later\n2. Get TLS slot from global storage index\n3. If slot is empty, allocate and initialize new TLS block\n4. Store thread ID and initialize default value (-1) in TLS\n5. Restore original error code\n6. Return pointer to TLS block\n\nParameters:\n- None (implicit: Uses global g_dwThreadLocalStorageIndex)\n\nReturns:\n- DWORD*: Pointer to thread-local storage block (never NULL, calls exit on failure)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
