      "comment": "Initializes parsed command-line arguments array and sets initialization flags.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize module library if not already done\n2. Count non-null argument entries in command line string\n3. Allocate array for argument pointers\n4. Copy each argument from command line to allocated buffers\n5. Mark processing complete and set parsed arguments pointer\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: g_pCommandLine contains raw command-line string\n\nReturns:\n- void (exits program on allocation failure via __amsg_exit)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 4: Size of pointer in allocated array\n- 0x0: Sentinel value to mark array end",
