      "name": "InitializeHeapAndConfig",
      "signature": "uint InitializeHeapAndConfig(uint dwMode)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Initializes the game heap and configuration based on mode.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Create heap with specified mode (0=custom allocation strategy, non-zero=standard Windows heap)\n2. If heap creation succeeds, call InitializeHeapConfiguration to determine heap type\n3. If type is 3, allocate 0x3f8 bytes via FUN_6f919250; if type is 2, call FUN_6f919d97\n4. If allocation/initialization pointer is NULL, destroy the heap and return failure (0)\n5. Return success (1) if all operations complete\n\nParameters:\n- dwMode (uint): Heap creation mode flag (0=custom, non-zero=standard)\n\nReturns:\n- 1 on successful heap and configuration initialization\n- 0 if heap creation fails or allocation pointer is NULL",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
