      "comment": "Destroys memory allocations and cleanup resources based on cleanup mode.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If mode is 3: free virtual memory allocations and heap entries in loop\n2. If mode is 2: traverse linked list and free virtual memory blocks\n3. Finally destroy the heap handle\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: DAT_6f9cf1a8 - cleanup mode (2 or 3)\n- IMPLICIT: DAT_6f9cdf50 - allocation count\n- IMPLICIT: DAT_6f9cdf54 - allocation table pointer\n- IMPLICIT: DAT_6f9cf1a4 - heap handle\n\nReturns:\n- void",
