      "name": "FindFirstCharInSet",
      "signature": "byte * FindFirstCharInSet(byte * pbSearchStr, byte * pbCharSet)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Scans pbSearchStr for first byte found in pbCharSet using bitmap lookup.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Build 256-bit bitmap from all bytes in pbCharSet\n2. For each byte in pbSearchStr:\n   - If byte is in bitmap, return pointer to that byte\n   - If null terminator found, return null\n   \nParameters:\n- pbSearchStr: String to search for characters\n- pbCharSet: String of characters to find (null-terminated)\n\nReturns:\n- Pointer to first byte in pbSearchStr that matches a byte in pbCharSet\n- NULL if no match found or pbSearchStr is empty",
