      "name": "InitializationOnce",
      "signature": "void InitializationOnce(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Performs one-time initialization using double-checked locking pattern.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if g_dwInitialized flag is set (fast path, no lock)\n2. If not initialized:\n   - Acquire critical section 0xb (mutex)\n   - Re-check flag inside lock (prevent race condition)\n   - Call FUN_6f9175a5() to perform actual initialization\n   - Increment g_dwInitialized flag to mark initialized\n   - Release critical section\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: Critical section index 0xb (hardcoded)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nNote: Double-checked locking ensures thread-safe one-time initialization with minimal lock contention after first call.",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
