      "name": "InitializeTimeZoneInfo",
      "signature": "void InitializeTimeZoneInfo(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initializes timezone offset information from environment variable or system.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Acquire critical section lock (index 0xc)\n2. If TZ environment variable exists, parse time offset as hours:minutes:seconds\n3. Otherwise, call GetTimeZoneInformation to retrieve system timezone\n4. Calculate base offset in 60-second units (0x3c multiplier)\n5. Handle DST transitions if applicable\n6. Store string representations of timezone abbreviations via WideCharToMultiByte\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: Global variables DAT_6f9cde38+ (TIME_ZONE_INFORMATION structure)\n- IMPLICIT: Critical section index 0xc for synchronization\n\nReturns:\n- void (initializes globals: g_dwBaseOffset, DAT_6f9cde30, PTR_DAT_6f92219c, PTR_DAT_6f9221a0)",
