      "name": "CalcEventSlotAndTime",
      "signature": "void CalcEventSlotAndTime(int nMode, int nType, uint dwDay, int nSlot, int nRow, int nCol, int nOffset, int nHours, int nMinutes, int nSeconds, int nMillis)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Calculates event slot position and stores time data to global state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load base slot offset from table indexed by nSlot (varies by dwDay & 3)\n2. If nType == 1: Calculate modulo position within 7-column grid and adjust for row/column\n3. If nType != 1: Add nOffset directly to base slot offset\n4. Store results to global variables based on nMode\n5. Wrap time values to 24-hour cycle (86400000ms)\n\nParameters:\n- nMode: 1 to store primary state, else secondary state\n- nType: 1 for grid calculation, else linear offset\n- dwDay: Day value (& 3 determines table selection)\n- nSlot: Slot index for offset table lookup\n- nRow: Row in grid (for type 1 mode)\n- nCol: Column in grid (for type 1 mode, 0-6)\n- nOffset: Direct offset addition (for type != 1)\n- nHours, nMinutes, nSeconds, nMillis: Time components\n\nReturns:\n- void (results stored to globals)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:6d50544faaf636cd3d820cef87818a92",
