      "name": "BufferValidateAndUpdateState",
      "signature": "uint BufferValidateAndUpdateState(uint dwBufferId, int nNewState, uint dwFlags)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Validate and update buffer state after write operations.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if buffer ID is within valid range via g_dwHandleLimit\n2. Check if buffer is allocated by testing allocation bit in buffer table\n3. If buffer valid: call pre-handler, apply state update, call post-handler, return result\n4. If buffer invalid: set error code 9, return 0xFFFFFFFF\n\nParameters:\n- dwBufferId (uint): Buffer handle ID to validate and update\n- nNewState (int): New state value to apply to buffer\n- dwFlags (uint): Operation flags controlling state update behavior\n\nReturns:\n- Result code from state update operation on success\n- 0xFFFFFFFF on buffer validation failure (invalid ID or unallocated buffer)",
