      "name": "SeekFileAndUpdateBuffer",
      "signature": "DWORD SeekFileAndUpdateBuffer(uint nBufferId, long nOffset, DWORD dwMethod)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Seeks to a position in a file and updates the associated buffer state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get file handle for the buffer ID via FUN_6f91a9ed\n2. If handle invalid (0xffffffff), set error code 9 and return failure\n3. Call SetFilePointer with offset and seek method (FILE_BEGIN/CURRENT/END)\n4. If seek failed (returned 0xffffffff), get error code via GetLastError\n5. On success (uVar4 == 0), clear bit 0x02 in buffer state and return seek position\n6. On error, call FUN_6f91a8e9 error handler and return 0xffffffff\n\nParameters:\n- nBufferId (uint): Index into buffer table, used to locate file handle and state\n- nOffset (LONG): Offset for SetFilePointer (can be negative for relative seeks)\n- dwMethod (DWORD): Seek method (FILE_BEGIN=0, FILE_CURRENT=1, FILE_END=2)\n\nReturns:\n- New file position on success, 0xffffffff on failure\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xffffffff: Invalid handle/error indicator\n- 0x24 (36): Buffer entry size in bytes\n- 0x1f (31): Mask for buffer index within 32-entry group\n- 0x02: Bit flag cleared in buffer state (purpose unclear without context)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
