      "signature": "void BufferAllocateWriteArea(int * pBuffer)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Allocates a write buffer for a buffer node, handling allocation failure gracefully.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Increment global allocation counter\n2. Allocate 0x1000 bytes from memory pool\n3. Store allocated pointer in pBuffer[2]\n4. If allocation fails, set fallback pointer to pBuffer[5] and set size to 2\n5. If allocation succeeds, set capacity flag and size to 0x1000\n6. Initialize write pointer pBuffer[0] and position pBuffer[1]\n\nParameters:\n- pBuffer (int*): Pointer to buffer node structure\n\nReturns:\n- void",
