      "name": "AcquireFileLock",
      "signature": "void AcquireFileLock(dword dwFilePtr)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Acquires appropriate lock for file structure based on address range.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if file pointer is in thread-local pool range (0x6f92222f-0x6f922491)\n2. If in range: calculate critical section index and acquire via AcquireCriticalSectionIndex\n3. If out of range: acquire lock via EnterCriticalSection on file structure\n\nParameters:\n- dwFilePtr (dword): Address of FILE structure or thread-local pool entry\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x6f92222f, 0x6f922491: Thread-local pool address range boundaries\n- 0x20: Offset to lock field in FILE structure\n- 0x906dddd0, 0x1c: Critical section index calculation constants",
