      "name": "AcquireCriticalSectionIfValid",
      "signature": "void AcquireCriticalSectionIfValid(int nIndexOrHandle, void * pCriticalSectionStruct)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Acquires a critical section, routing to either index-based or pointer-based acquisition.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if nIndexOrHandle < 0x14 (20 decimal)\n2. If less: call AcquireCriticalSectionIndex with (nIndexOrHandle + 0x1c)\n3. If greater or equal: call EnterCriticalSection with pointer at (pCriticalSectionStruct + 0x20)\n\nParameters:\n- nIndexOrHandle (int): Index or handle value; if < 0x14, treated as index offset\n- pCriticalSectionStruct (void*): Pointer to structure containing critical section\n\nReturns:\n- void (always succeeds or doesn't return)",
