      "name": "ReleaseLock",
      "signature": "void ReleaseLock(void * pLock)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Releases either a standard CRITICAL_SECTION or indexed critical section lock.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if pLock points to indexed critical section range\n2. If indexed: Extract index from address, call ReleaseCriticalSectionIndex\n3. If standard: Call LeaveCriticalSection on lock pointer\n\nParameters:\n- pLock (void*): Lock/critical section handle or pointer to indexed lock\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x6f92222f, 0x6f922491: Indexed critical section address range\n- 0x906dddd0: Address adjustment for index calculation\n- 0x20: Offset to CRITICAL_SECTION within structure",
