      "comment": "Releases a critical section by index, using either indexed or context-based release.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if section index is less than 0x14 (20)\n2. If yes, release indexed critical section at (nSectionIndex + 0x1c)\n3. If no, release context critical section at (nContext + 0x20)\n4. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\n- nSectionIndex (int): Critical section index to release (0-19 for indexed sections)\n- nContext (int): Context structure pointer for sections >= 20\n\nReturns:\n- void: No return value, always succeeds or calls appropriate release function",
