      "comment": "Converts a wide character to multibyte encoding in destination buffer.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Return early if destination is null\n2. If string compare mode is 0, convert directly if wchar < 0x100\n3. Otherwise call WideCharToMultiByte with default code page\n4. Return converted string or error code 0xffffffff on failure\n\nParameters:\n- lpszDest (LPSTR): Output buffer for converted character\n- wchSrc (WCHAR): Wide character to convert\n\nReturns:\n- Non-zero on success, 0xffffffff on conversion failure",
