      "name": "SetFPUControlWordMasked",
      "signature": "void SetFPUControlWordMasked(void * this, void * pThis, dword dwControlMask, dword dwControlValue)",
      "calling_convention": "__thiscall",
      "comment": "Sets FPU control word with mask applied to control value.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Receives FPU control value and mask parameters\n2. Applies 0xfff7ffff mask to control value (clears bit 19)\n3. Calls ModifyFPUControlWord with masked control value\n4. Returns to caller\n\nParameters:\n- this (void*): Processor context object (ECX, __thiscall)\n- dwControlMask: Mask value for FPU control word bits\n- dwControlValue: New FPU control word value to apply\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xfff7ffff: Mask that clears bit 19 of control value\n\nRelated Functions:\n- ModifyFPUControlWord: Updates the actual FPU control register",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:03d2d9a1894bad6481c3d75928ae7b95",
