      "name": "ConvertFPUControlWordBits",
      "signature": "uint ConvertFPUControlWordBits(uint dwInputCtrlWord)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Converts x87 FPU control word bits from Storm format to Windows/CPU format.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Map input bit positions to output bit positions using conditional ORs\n2. Process individual flag bits (0x1, 0x2, 0x4, 0x8, 0x10, 0x80000) to output positions (0x20, 0x10, 0x8, 0x4, 0x1, 0x2)\n3. Decode rounding mode from input bits 0x300 (0x100\u21920x400, 0x200\u21920x800, 0x300\u21920xc00)\n4. Decode exception mask from input bits 0x30000 (default 0x300, 0x10000\u21920x200)\n5. Map precision control bit 0x40000 to output 0x1000\n6. Return converted control word\n\nParameters:\n- dwInputCtrlWord (uint): FPU control word in Storm format\n\nReturns:\n- uint: FPU control word in Windows/CPU format (x87 hardware format)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:13aed512c644fb08ccd536c95b2ae182",
