      "comment": "Copies a fixed 3-element dword array from source to destination with offset.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate destination address as nOffset + pdwSrc\n2. Initialize counter to 3\n3. Copy 3 dwords from source pointer to destination\n4. Increment source pointer for each dword\n\nParameters:\n- nOffset (int): Byte offset to destination address from base\n- pdwSrc (uint*): Source pointer to 3 dwords to copy\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nNotes:\n- Always copies exactly 3 dwords (12 bytes)",
