      "name": "ValidateThreeIntsZero",
      "signature": "bool ValidateThreeIntsZero(int * pnValues)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Validates that three consecutive int values are all zero.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize counter to 0\n2. Check if current int value is non-zero - return false if so\n3. Increment counter and advance pointer to next int\n4. Repeat while counter < 3\n5. Return true if all three are zero\n\nParameters:\n- pnValues (int*): Pointer to array of at least 3 int values\n\nReturns:\n- true (1) if all three ints are zero\n- false (0) if any int is non-zero",
