      "name": "ProcessExponentData",
      "signature": "void ProcessExponentData(ushort * pExponentData, uint * pdwOutputBuffer)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Wrapper for exponent/mantissa conversion using global parameter table.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call ProcessExponentMantissa with exponent data, output buffer, and global parameter array\n2. Return result\n\nParameters:\n- pExponentData (ushort*): Exponent data buffer (6 elements)\n- pdwOutputBuffer (uint*): Output buffer for mantissa data\n\nReturns:\n- Conversion result (1=success, 2=normal, 0=zero exponent)",
