      "name": "FormatDoubleValue",
      "signature": "int * FormatDoubleValue(uint dwValue1, uint dwValue2, int * pnResult, uint * pdwOutput)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Formats double value components for string conversion.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract high 16 bits of dwValue2 as exponent equivalent\n2. Call FUN_6f9188ea to process mantissa/value data\n3. Call FUN_6f91b2da to format decimal representation\n4. Store result code, first digit, and exponent flag in output array\n5. Copy formatted string to output buffer\n6. Return pointer to result array\n\nParameters:\n- dwValue1 (uint): First value component (mantissa)\n- dwValue2 (uint): Second value component (exponent in high 16 bits)\n- pnResult (int*): Pointer to result array [digit, exponent, code, pointer]\n- pdwOutput (uint*): Pointer to output string buffer\n\nReturns:\n- Pointer to pnResult array\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x10 (16): Bit shift for exponent extraction\n- 0x11 (17): Formatting precision/mode flag\n- 24: Output string buffer size (local_28)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
