      "name": "ResolveCodePageConstant",
      "signature": "uint ResolveCodePageConstant(int nCodePage)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Resolves special code page constants to actual code page values.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Clear g_fCodePageResolved flag\n2. If nCodePage == -2 (CP_OEMCP): Set flag, return GetOEMCP()\n3. If nCodePage == -3 (CP_ACP): Set flag, return GetACP()\n4. If nCodePage == -4: Set flag, return g_nDefaultCodePage\n5. Otherwise return nCodePage unchanged (flag stays 0)\n\nParameters:\n- nCodePage (int): Code page or special constant (-2/-3/-4)\n\nReturns:\n- Resolved code page number (UINT)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- -2: CP_OEMCP - Use OEM code page\n- -3: CP_ACP - Use ANSI code page\n- -4: Use default code page from g_nDefaultCodePage",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
