      "name": "CodePageToLCID",
      "signature": "uint CodePageToLCID(uint dwCodePage)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Maps Windows code page to corresponding locale ID (LCID).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if code page matches one of four supported East Asian pages\n2. Return corresponding LCID or 0 if unsupported\n\nParameters:\n- dwCodePage (uint): Windows code page identifier\n\nReturns:\n- LCID for supported code pages, 0 otherwise\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x3a4 (932): Japanese code page \u2192 0x411 (ja-JP)\n- 0x3a8 (936): Chinese Simplified \u2192 0x804 (zh-CN)\n- 0x3b5 (949): Korean \u2192 0x412 (ko-KR)\n- 0x3b6 (950): Chinese Traditional \u2192 0x404 (zh-TW)",
