      "name": "BuildMbcsCharacterClassTables",
      "signature": "void BuildMbcsCharacterClassTables(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Builds MBCS character class tables for case conversion.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call GetCPInfo to get current code page info\n2. If successful:\n   a. Initialize szCharBuffer with identity mapping (0x00-0xFF)\n   b. Set lead bytes (DBCS) to space (0x20) to mark them\n   c. Call LocaleMapStringWithConversion 3x to get char types, upper, lower\n   d. For each char, set class flags and case conversion in global tables\n3. If GetCPInfo fails, fallback to ASCII A-Z/a-z only\n\nParameters:\n- None (void)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x10: Upper case flag in abCharacterClassTable\n- 0x20: Lower case flag in abCharacterClassTable\n- 0x41-0x5A: ASCII 'A'-'Z'\n- 0x61-0x7A: ASCII 'a'-'z'\n\nRelated Functions:\n- InitMbcsCharacterClassTable (caller)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:63906d1f35f7842042066a6643d2050c",
