      "name": "InitializeAllocTable",
      "signature": "bool InitializeAllocTable(uint dwAllocLimit)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Initializes the allocation tracking table for heap management.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Allocate 0x140 (320) bytes from global heap for table storage\n2. If allocation fails, return failure\n3. Initialize tracking globals: index=0, count=0, capacity=0x10\n4. Store allocation limit parameter for mode 3 operations\n5. Return success\n\nParameters:\n- dwAllocLimit (uint): Maximum allocation limit for mode 3 operations\n\nReturns:\n- true (1): Table initialized successfully\n- false (0): Heap allocation failed\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x140 (320): Table size in bytes (0x10 entries * 0x14 bytes each)\n- 0x10 (16): Initial table capacity in entries",
