      "name": "FreePoolNode",
      "signature": "void FreePoolNode(void * * ppNode)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Frees a pool node and its virtual memory, unlinking from doubly-linked list.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Free virtual memory at ppNode[4] (offset 0x10) with MEM_RELEASE\n2. If this node is the list head, update g_pPoolListHead to next node\n3. If node is the static sentinel (g_PoolNodeStatic), set state to -1 and return\n4. Otherwise, unlink from list: prev->next = next, next->prev = prev\n5. Free the node structure via HeapFree\n\nParameters:\n- ppNode (void**): Pointer to pool node structure to free\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nNode Structure Layout:\n- [0x00] pNext: Pointer to next node\n- [0x04] pPrev: Pointer to previous node\n- [0x10] pVirtualMem: Virtual memory block to release",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
