      "name": "ShowMessageBoxWithActiveWindow",
      "signature": "int ShowMessageBoxWithActiveWindow(char * lpszText, char * lpszCaption, uint dwType)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Displays a message box using dynamically loaded user32.dll.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if MessageBoxA is already cached\n2. If not, load user32.dll via LoadLibraryA\n3. Get proc addresses for MessageBoxA, GetActiveWindow, GetLastActivePopup\n4. Get active window and last active popup for parent handle\n5. Call MessageBoxA with resolved parent window\n\nParameters:\n- lpszText (char*): Message text to display\n- lpszCaption (char*): Dialog caption/title\n- dwType (uint): MessageBox flags (MB_OK, MB_ICONERROR, etc.)\n\nReturns:\n- MessageBox result (IDOK, IDCANCEL, etc.), or 0 on failure\n\nGlobals:\n- g_pfnMessageBoxA: Cached MessageBoxA function pointer\n- g_pfnGetActiveWindow: Cached GetActiveWindow function pointer\n- g_pfnGetLastActivePopup: Cached GetLastActivePopup function pointer",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
