      "name": "SaveUnwindContext",
      "signature": "void SaveUnwindContext(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Saves SEH unwind context before invoking exception handlers.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Save [EBP+8] (handler parameter) to g_dwUnwindParam\n2. Save EAX (current context) to g_dwUnwindEax\n3. Save EBP (stack frame) to g_dwUnwindEbp\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: EAX contains context value to preserve\n- IMPLICIT: EBP+8 contains handler parameter\n\nReturns:\n- void (context saved to global structure)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- __local_unwind2: Caller that invokes exception handlers",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:ed17ad9d511f6e330c2b6a62378d83cf",
