      "name": "CompareStringsCaseInsensitive",
      "signature": "int CompareStringsCaseInsensitive(byte * pbStr1, char * szStr2, uint dwMaxChars)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Compares two strings case-insensitively up to nMaxChars characters.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If nMaxChars is 0, return 0 (equal)\n2. If g_dwStringCompareMode == 0, use fast ASCII case folding (A-Z -> a-z)\n3. Otherwise acquire critical section 0x13 and use TransformCharacterCase for locale-aware comparison\n4. Compare character by character until mismatch, null terminator, or nMaxChars reached\n\nParameters:\n- pbStr1 (byte*): First null-terminated string\n- szStr2 (char*): Second null-terminated string  \n- nMaxChars (uint): Maximum characters to compare\n\nReturns:\n- 0: Strings are equal\n- -1: pbStr1 < szStr2\n- 1: pbStr1 > szStr2\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x13 (19): Critical section index for locale operations\n- 0x41-0x5A: ASCII 'A'-'Z' range for case folding\n- 0x20: Offset to convert uppercase to lowercase",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:662566ebcde3842108cf876001e2ae79",
