      "name": "GetTlsErrnoPtr",
      "signature": "uint * GetTlsErrnoPtr(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Returns pointer to errno field in thread-local storage.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call GetThreadLocalStorage to get TLS block pointer\n2. Add offset 8 (2 DWORDs) to reach errno field\n3. Return pointer to errno storage location\n\nParameters:\n- None (uses global TLS index internally)\n\nReturns:\n- uint*: Pointer to thread's errno value at TLS offset 0x8\n\nTLS Block Layout:\n- Offset 0x0: Thread ID (DWORD)\n- Offset 0x4: Default value (DWORD, init -1)\n- Offset 0x8: errno value (DWORD) <- this function",
