      "name": "InvalidateFileHandle",
      "signature": "int InvalidateFileHandle(uint dwHandleIndex)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Invalidates a file handle entry in the CRT handle table.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validates handle index against g_dwHandleLimit\n2. Locates entry in g_pBufferTable using index (entry size=0x24)\n3. Checks if entry is valid (flag byte & 1) and open (!= -1)\n4. For stdin(0)/stdout(1)/stderr(2), calls SetStdHandle to clear\n5. Marks entry as invalid (-1 sentinel value)\n6. Sets errno=EBADF(9) on invalid handles\n\nParameters:\n- dwHandleIndex (uint): CRT file handle index to invalidate\n\nReturns:\n- 0: Success, handle invalidated\n- -1: Failure, invalid handle (errno set to EBADF)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x24 (36): Handle table entry stride\n- 0x1f (31): Mask for index within table segment\n- 0xfffffff6 (-10): STD_INPUT_HANDLE\n- 0xfffffff5 (-11): STD_OUTPUT_HANDLE\n- 0xfffffff4 (-12): STD_ERROR_HANDLE\n- 9: EBADF errno value",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:c2bda2cc0331ae5bf6246d61a0224d72",
