      "name": "UnlockBufferSlotCriticalSection",
      "signature": "void UnlockBufferSlotCriticalSection(uint dwBufferId)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Release critical section for a buffer slot.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract slot index from buffer ID (lower 5 bits)\n2. Extract table index from buffer ID (upper bits >> 5)\n3. Calculate critical section address at offset 0xC in buffer entry\n4. Call LeaveCriticalSection to release lock\n\nParameters:\n- dwBufferId (uint): Buffer handle containing table and slot indices\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x1F (31): Mask for slot index (5 bits, 32 slots per table)\n- 0x5: Right shift for table index\n- 0x24 (36): Buffer entry stride\n- 0xC (12): Offset to CRITICAL_SECTION within entry\n\nRelated Functions:\n- LockBufferSlotCriticalSection: Acquire lock counterpart",
