      "name": "FlushBufferToFile",
      "signature": "int FlushBufferToFile(int * pBuffer)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Flushes buffer data to file and optionally syncs to disk.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FlushFileBuffer to write pending data\n2. If flush fails, return -1\n3. If sync flag (0x40) set at offset 0xd, call FUN_6f91b7d2 to sync\n4. Return 0 on success, -1 if sync fails\n\nParameters:\n- pBuffer (int*): Buffer structure pointer\n\nReturns:\n- 0 on success\n- -1 on failure (flush or sync error)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xd: Offset to flags byte in buffer structure\n- 0x40: Sync-to-disk flag (FlushFileBuffers required)\n- 0x10: Offset to file handle in buffer structure",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:0db91ea76f5c7c9fd0bef446c106db61",
