      "name": "UInt32Add",
      "signature": "bool UInt32Add(uint dwAugend, uint dwAddend, uint * pdwResult)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Add two unsigned 32-bit integers with overflow detection.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Compute sum = dwAugend + dwAddend\n2. Check overflow via comparison (sum < dwAugend || sum < dwAddend)\n3. Store result in pdwResult output parameter\n4. Return TRUE (1) if overflow, FALSE (0) otherwise\n\nParameters:\n- dwAugend (uint): First operand\n- dwAddend (uint): Second operand  \n- pdwResult (uint*): Output pointer for sum\n\nReturns:\n- TRUE (1): Overflow occurred (result invalid)\n- FALSE (0): No overflow (result valid)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- ___add_12: Multi-word addition using this function",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:bff073652f00cbfc0b0f227bb7a313e1",
