      "comment": "Shifts a 96-bit value left by 1 bit with carry propagation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Save low and mid DWORDs\n2. Shift low DWORD left by 1 (multiply by 2)\n3. Shift mid DWORD left by 1, OR in carry from low (bit 31)\n4. Shift high DWORD left by 1, OR in carry from mid (bit 31)\n\nParameters:\n- pdwValue (uint*): Pointer to 3-DWORD (96-bit) value [low, mid, high]\n\nReturns:\n- void (modifies value in place)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- ___add_12: Adds two 96-bit values (used with shift for multiply by 10)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:58ce78ec7b76961d09886d9a93b93cae",
