      "name": "ShiftRight96Bit",
      "signature": "void ShiftRight96Bit(uint * pdwValue)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Shifts a 96-bit value right by 1 bit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Save middle dword (pdwValue[1])\n2. Shift middle dword right, OR in MSB from high dword\n3. Shift high dword (pdwValue[2]) right by 1\n4. Shift low dword right, OR in MSB from saved middle value\n\nParameters:\n- pdwValue (uint*): Pointer to 3-element uint array (96 bits total)\n  - [0] = low 32 bits\n  - [1] = middle 32 bits\n  - [2] = high 32 bits\n\nReturns:\n- void (result stored in-place)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- ShiftLeft96Bit: Shifts 96-bit value left by 1 bit",
