      "name": "CharToUppercase",
      "signature": "uint CharToUppercase(uint dwChar)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Converts a character to uppercase.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If g_dwStringCompareMode == 0 (fast ASCII mode):\n   - If char is 'a'-'z' (0x61-0x7a), subtract 0x20 to convert to 'A'-'Z'\n   - Otherwise return unchanged\n2. If g_dwStringCompareMode != 0 (locale-aware mode):\n   - Increment semaphore count, acquire critical section 0x13 if needed\n   - Call FUN_6f91b5dc for locale-aware uppercase conversion\n   - Release critical section or decrement semaphore count\n   - Return converted character\n\nParameters:\n- dwChar (uint): Character code to convert (ASCII or locale-specific)\n\nReturns:\n- Uppercase character code, or original if not convertible\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x61 (97): ASCII 'a' lowercase start\n- 0x7a (122): ASCII 'z' lowercase end\n- 0x20 (32): ASCII case conversion offset\n- 0x13 (19): Critical section index for locale operations",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:e038b71e990839fd36df244ad8c1a314",
