      "name": "CloseFileStream",
      "signature": "int CloseFileStream(FILE * pFile)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Closes a FILE stream with proper synchronization.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if stream is a string buffer (flag 0x40)\n2. If string buffer: Clear flags and return -1 (EOF)\n3. Otherwise: Acquire file lock, call internal close, release lock\n\nParameters:\n- pFile (FILE*): File stream to close\n\nReturns:\n- 0 on success\n- -1 (EOF) on error or for string buffers\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x40: FILE_STRING_BUFFER flag (no real close needed)\n- 0xFFFFFFFF: EOF/-1 error return value",
