      "name": "CommitBufferFlush",
      "signature": "int CommitBufferFlush(uint dwSlotHandle)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Commits pending buffer data by flushing the underlying file handle.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate slot handle is within g_dwHandleLimit\n2. Check buffer slot is active (flag & 0x1)\n3. Lock the buffer slot critical section\n4. Re-verify slot is still active after lock\n5. Get file handle via GetFileHandleFromBuffer\n6. Call FlushFileBuffers to commit data\n7. Store error code in TLS if flush fails\n8. Unlock critical section and return\n\nParameters:\n- dwSlotHandle (uint): Buffer slot index to flush\n\nReturns:\n- 0 on success\n- -1 (0xFFFFFFFF) on failure with errno set to EBADF (9)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x24 (36): Buffer slot structure stride\n- 0x1F (31): Mask for slot within table group\n- 0x5: Shift for table group index (32 slots per group)\n- 0x9: EBADF - Bad file descriptor errno",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:b14dfb771e9c85951130aa7c0ee6e7bc",
