      "name": "CloseBufferSlot",
      "signature": "int CloseBufferSlot(uint dwHandle)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Closes a file buffer slot with thread-safe locking.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate handle < g_dwHandleLimit\n2. Check slot's active flag (byte at offset 4, bit 0)\n3. If valid: lock slot, call CloseBufferSlotInternal, unlock\n4. If invalid: set errno=9 (EBADF), clear WinError\n\nParameters:\n- dwHandle (uint): File handle/buffer slot index\n\nReturns:\n- 0 on success\n- -1 on failure (invalid handle or close error)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x24 (36): Buffer slot structure stride\n- 0x1f (31): Mask for slot index within table segment\n- 9: EBADF (bad file descriptor)",
