      "name": "CloseBufferSlotInternal",
      "signature": "int CloseBufferSlotInternal(uint dwSlotIndex)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Closes a buffer slot's file handle and clears its active flag.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get handle from slot; exit early if INVALID_HANDLE_VALUE\n2. If stdout/stderr (slot 1/2), skip close if handles are identical\n3. Call CloseHandle on the file handle\n4. If close fails, capture Windows error code\n5. Invalidate handle in buffer table\n6. Clear active flag at offset 0x4 in slot structure (stride 0x24)\n7. Map Windows error to errno if close failed\n\nParameters:\n- dwSlotIndex (uint): Buffer slot index to close\n\nReturns:\n- 0 on success, -1 on CloseHandle failure\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x24 (36): Buffer slot structure stride\n- 0x4: Offset to active flag in slot structure\n- 1, 2: Standard output and standard error slot indices",
