      "name": "ReleasePoolCriticalSection",
      "signature": "void ReleasePoolCriticalSection(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Releases the pool critical section (index 9).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calls ReleaseCriticalSectionIndex with index 9\n2. Returns immediately\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 9: Pool/heap critical section index\n\nRelated Functions:\n- AcquireCriticalSectionIndex(9): Acquires this critical section\n- FUN_6f91c0cf: Memory reallocation caller",
