      "name": "ReleasePoolCriticalSectionClearEdi",
      "signature": "void ReleasePoolCriticalSectionClearEdi(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Releases pool critical section and clears EDI register.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call ReleaseCriticalSectionIndex(9) to release pool lock\n2. XOR EDI with itself to clear it to zero\n3. Return\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- void (EDI implicitly cleared to 0 as side effect)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 9: Pool/heap critical section index\n\nRelated Functions:\n- ReleasePoolCriticalSection: Same but without EDI clear\n- AcquireCriticalSectionIndex: Acquires the lock",
