      "comment": "Allocates memory and creates a copy of a null-terminated string.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Return NULL if source string is NULL\n2. Calculate length via strlen\n3. Allocate length+1 bytes for copy\n4. Return NULL if allocation fails\n5. Copy string using CopyStringAligned and return result\n\nParameters:\n- szSource (char*): Null-terminated source string to duplicate\n\nReturns:\n- char* to newly allocated copy, or NULL on failure\n\nNotes:\n- Caller is responsible for freeing the returned memory",
